WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400
Auntie, what do you want to do?

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:03,800
My main purpose here is to smash down these two walls.

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,000
After smashing it, those messy things need to be taken away.

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:07,600
Then we mainly do these tasks, right?

5
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:10,200
Yes, because the decoration company originally wanted to charge me a sum of money

6
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:12,000
But they charge too much and I don't want to

7
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,000
So I told them to just let them decorate it at that time.

8
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:15,200
I'll finish this house

9
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:17,000
Well, if you want to say that

10
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:19,000
Then we can give you a more reasonable price

11
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:20,000
One thousand eight hundred yuan

12
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,200
Can it be more convenient?

13
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:22,800
Auntie, you need to smash these two walls

14
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:24,200
There are still so many materials to transport.

15
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:25,600
This is actually not a small amount of work.

16
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:27,200
The price we gave is already taking care of you.

17
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:30,800
I know, I know, the price you quoted is cheaper than what the decoration company quoted us.

18
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:32,800
But there are a lot of places where I spend money on decoration.

19
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:35,200
I spend so much money here, and I'm worried about whether it will be enough later.

20
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:36,800
So can you give me a cheaper price?

21
00:00:36,800 --> 00:00:39,800
Auntie, do you have a lot of garbage to get rid of here?

22
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:42,000
Also, do you want to get rid of some of the clothes at home?

23
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:43,000
Want it, want it

24
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:44,600
I have collected a lot from here.

25
00:00:44,600 --> 00:00:46,200
I was about to say throw it away

26
00:00:46,200 --> 00:00:48,200
But I’m an old woman and it’s hard to throw it away.

27
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:50,200
So I have to trouble you to help me get it down.

28
00:00:50,200 --> 00:00:52,800
Alas, it is already very difficult for me to go up and down the stairs on the sixth floor.

29
00:00:52,800 --> 00:00:55,400
You want me to get something without knowing when I will get it

30
00:00:55,400 --> 00:00:57,800
Otherwise, I have to ask my kids to come over and throw it away for me.
